NotoSansMonoCJKSC-subset.otf
============================

This file is a glyph-subset of "Noto Sans Mono CJK SC" (Regular), extracted from
Google's Noto Sans CJK fonts for hermetic visual tests.

Source: Noto Sans CJK (https://github.com/notofonts/noto-cjk)
License: SIL Open Font License 1.1 (https://scripts.sil.org/OFL)

Only the glyphs needed by flutter_alacritty visual tests are retained
(ASCII printable + 中文测试). It is not a complete font for general use.
